		(property "Function" "Buffers the single-pole filtered EREF (R506/C506, 704 Hz, S-27). U3B (pins 5/6/7) drives EREF_BUF to R1002 and R507. U3A is an unloaded follower with +IN on the same node, so its output stays inside the specified linear range (TI SBOS513F 7.5: AOL for 0.1 V < VO < V+ - 0.1 V). Bypass pins 8/4 locally."
